title: InterviewDay1
---
Don Contento: Alright, first question… Who would you consider to be your idol?

-> Robert F. Kennedy Sr
    Don Espresso: HE’SAFED!
    Don Contento: Now, now, hold on. I’m sure he was just breaking balls. You were, weren’t you? 
    -> No, I’m serious. I always admired his toughness on crime!
        Contento: Really?
    -> Yes
        Contento: Alright, Espresso. You can shoot him. Next!
        BANG!
        GAME OVER
        <<stop>>
    -> No
        Contento: See, I knew he was joking! Won’t lie, you had me for a second there.
        Espresso: I got my eye on you…
        You have lost favor with Don Espresso
        <<set $espressoFavor = $espressoFavor - 1>>
        <<detour judgement>>
    -> Yeah, I’m just breaking balls
        Calvo: You got some nerve…!
        Contento: Gentlemen, settle down! You can tear each other’s heads off later. Now’s the time to find people to help ya do it, hahaha! Next question!
        Contento: Glad you got a sense of humor kid, but be careful, Espresso’s coffee addiction gets him pretty antsy…
        Espresso: I’MNOTADDICTEDICANQUITEANYTIMEIWANT!
        Calvo: Yeah, I’m sure you’ve quit three times this week!
        Espresso: YOULOOKINGTOGETWHACKEDTODAYYOUBALDSONOFABITCH?!
-> Al Capone
    Contento: Same! What’s your favorite thing about him?
    -> His hat
        Contento: It’s a classic! I own a few fedoras myself, my kid says it makes me look like a nice guy! Didn’t seem very complimentary though
    -> The tax evasion
        Contento: Hey, be careful with the tax evasion. That’s how they got ‘im.
    -> His charitable acts
        Contento: Oh yeah, I always dress up as Santa at Christmas, just like he did.
        You have curried favor with Don Contento
        <<set $contentoFavor = $contentoFavor + 1>>
-> Mickey Mouse
    Don Contento: Finally, a sense of humor!
    You have curried favor with Don Contento
    <<set $contentoFavor = $contentoFavor + 1>>

Don Lacrimoso: Alright Contento, you’ve eaten up enough time.
Don Lacrimoso: My turn. What would you do if you felt like you didn’t wanna get out of bed?

-> I’d push myself to get out all the same
    Don Contento: My kinda guy!
    Don Bill: The uncaring cruelty of the universe shrinks in the face of the indomitable human spirit
    You have curried favor with Don Contento and Don Bill
    <<set $contentoFavor = $contentoFavor + 1>>
    <<set $billFavor = $billFavor + 1>>
    Don Lacrimoso: Like it’s that easy…
    You’ve lost favor with Don Lacrimoso
    <<set $lacrimosoFavor = $lacrimosoFavor - 1>>
    <<detour judgement>>
-> I’m not sure.
    Don Lacrimoso: Alright…
-> I’d probably have to be dragged out…
    Don Lacrimoso: Yeah, same…
    You have curried favor with Don Lacrimoso
    <<set $lacrimosoFavor = $lacrimosoFavor + 1>>

Don Calvo: How’s my hair look?
-> Pretty good!
    Don Calvo: Oh, thanks!
    You have curried favor with Don Calvo
    <<set $calvoFavor = $calvoFavor + 1>>
-> Very realistic!
    Don Calvo: You fucking with me?
    -> Yeah, it looks great.
        Don Calvo: Thanks
        You have curried favor with Don Calvo
        <<set $calvoFavor = $calvoFavor + 1>>
    -> Yeah, it looks fake
        Don Calvo: Son of a bitch!
        BANG!
        GAME OVER
        <<stop>>
    -> No, it looks very realistic!
        Don Calvo: Well, I, uh, don’t see why you would point that out, seeing as this is my very definitely real hair…
->That’s hair?
    BANG!
    GAME OVER
    <<stop>>

Don Espresso: YOUWANTSOMECOFFEE?!
->YEAH!
    Don Espresso: WHATKIND?
        ->Decaf
            Don Espresso: COWARD!
