-> No thanks, I’m good.
    Don Espresso: TOTALLYGETITIT’SNOTFOREVERYONE
<<wait  0.5>>
Don Bill: How ya doin’?
-> Alright
    Don Bill: Oh, alright
-> Pretty good
    Don Bill: That’s nice
    You have curried favor with Don Bill
