    <<jump InterviewDay1BillTherapyAnswer>>

===
title: InterviewDay1BillTherapyAnswer
---
-> My grandma’s not doing so great…
    Don Bill: I see. It can be hard losing a loved one, but we all go eventually. Best to accept it rather than waste your time mourning what’s yet to occur.
    -> Wow, thanks! That’s a really good way to look at things!
        Don Bill: No problem, if you ever need someone to talk to, you can just reach out to me.
        You have curried favor with Don Bill
        <<set $billFavor = $billFavor + 1>>
    -> I don’t need your advice, old man!
        Don Bill: Oh…
        You have lost favor with Don Bill. And hurt his feelings. Meanie
        <<set $billFavor = $billFavor - 1>>
        <<detour judgement>>
-> My girlfriend broke up with me…
    Don Bill: Oof! I’ve been there. Going through that can be tough, but at the end of the day, there are plenty of fish in the sea.
    -> I guess…
        Don Bill: Hey, chin up. You’ll find someone else
        You have curried favor with Don Bill
        <<set $billFavor = $billFavor + 1>>
    -> I just don’t know…
        Don Bill: I get it. Take your time
-> I don’t wanna talk about it…
    Don Bill: You sure? I’m here to listen.
    -> On second thought… 
        <<jump InterviewDay1BillTherapyAnswer>>
    -> No, I really don’t
        Don Bill: Ok, buddy. We can talk after if you want. And if you survive.
Don Calvo: Alright, get a move-on! This is an audition, not a therapy session! 
<<jump DonTrivia>>
