title: DonTrivia
---
Don Contento: Alright, trivia time! I’m gonna ask you a few questions about me, and if you get them right, you’ll curry favor with me. If you get them wrong, well… let’s just say it won’t be good for your health. You ready?
Don Contento: What is my favorite food?
-> Broccoli
    Don Contento: Good one!
-> Mac and Cheese
    Don Contento: Bingo!
